name 'ai-and-algorithmic-decisions-postassessment-q5_2025'

question 'A movie-ticket app shows the number of seats left for each showtime. When someone buys a ticket, the number instantly drops by 1 on everyone\'s screen. What part of the program keeps track of and updates that number?'

wrong 'A font setting that shrinks the text as seats fill up'
wrong 'A comment in the code that reminds developers how many seats were available'
wrong 'A server photo file that displays pictures of the seats'
right 'A variable that stores the number of seats and changes whenever a ticket is sold'

allow_multiple_attempts true

